  "summary": "DIR-098 Phase One plan (Master UI/UX Transformation - discovery, baseline, gates). S1: finalise the review-unit inventory via scripts/ux-inventory.mjs -> .bridge/evidence/dir098/inventory.json (58 routes -> 58 review units, 7 viewports 320-1920, 13 interaction-state categories, 195 test suites). S2: scaffold npm run test:ux-gates - a machine-checkable harness asserting (a) inventory completeness: every route in src/main.jsx has exactly one review unit, (b) the responsive-overflow contract (7 viewports, zero horizontal overflow) is wired, (c) the WCAG 2.1 AA contrast/touch/landmark gate is wired. S3: seed the prioritised defect register and the task register from the inventory (P0-P3). S4: capture the baseline screenshot set per review unit via the XAMPP-served Playwright harness (Apache 80/443, no rogue servers). S5: run npm run test:ux-gates and npm test (must exit 0) and submit evidence. Acceptance: inventory covers 100%% of routes; ux-gates harness runs and is green; registers seeded; baseline captured; npm test green; src/cv-templates 0-byte diff."
